kitty-placeholders

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Draw kitty images placed with Unicode placeholders (Claude Code images): bump vendored Ghostty to 9fc5ec6b, which resolves placeholders in the render state, build it with Zig 0.17, and draw every image from the render state list.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream herdr-app draws images from a Ghostty render state that resolves placeholders.
